        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah McLachlan\n- Songs: \"U Want Me 2\"\n- Albums: Closer: The Best of Sarah McLachlan, Laws of Illusion\n\nFacts:\n- \"U Want Me 2\" is a song by Sarah McLachlan and the lead original single from her 2008 greatest hits album Closer: The Best of Sarah McLachlan.\n- As of 2009, Sarah McLachlan had sold over 30 million albums worldwide.\n- \"U Want Me 2\" was also included on Sarah McLachlan's 2010 album Laws of Illusion.\n- Sarah McLachlan is known for her emotional ballads and mezzo-soprano vocal range.",
